      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm just a subtraction from everyone's life lately. honestly, seeing how much harder everything is for my kids because i can't do the simple stuff anymore... it makes me think that if i just wasn't a factor, their lives would actually be easier. like, it's just math at this point. i'm just a drain on their happiness.",
